{
  "title": "博望活动｜新《公司法》下博望马俊龙律师受花椒学社邀请开展《餐饮企业顶层股权架构搭建》专题分享",
  "author": "博望餐饮法务团队",
  "publish_time": "2024年7月16日 16:25",
  "content_html": "<section style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(6, 5, 8); letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 2.25; padding: 0px 1px; box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"100000013\" data-ratio=\"0.24559777571825764\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jNSvMVkX72L826RPff6TOIiabMvBmE36mfsrY4oZfPcLGhUVtGkiaHxh2MALUmmbmhUFwDhakaDGtKVvNyKMMoLg/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=0\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 674.938px !important;\" data-original-style=\"\" data-index=\"3\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jNSvMVkX72L826RPff6TOIiabMvBmE36mfsrY4oZfPcLGhUVtGkiaHxh2MALUmmbmhUFwDhakaDGtKVvNyKMMoLg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\" _width=\"677px\" data-order=\"0\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"0\" data-fail=\"0\"></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px; line-height: 2; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">知法/守法/懂法/用法</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">用心维护餐饮人的利益</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">是我们热爱的法律事业</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">「 博望餐饮法务咨询团队 」</p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 90%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JlJ4EzGFC1aHQGzImCnmwWopyw12NRe9UcmHYB6blajG77Kar0nzJicB8X2erhKOACoJS758n9LAg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=1\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 607.5px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"4\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JlJ4EzGFC1aHQGzImCnmwWopyw12NRe9UcmHYB6blajG77Kar0nzJicB8X2erhKOACoJS758n9LAg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(6, 5, 8); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"padding-right: 30px; padding-left: 30px; line-height: 2; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></p><p style=\"visibility: visible;\">2024年7月15日，北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所股权高级合伙人、博望餐饮法务咨询首席法务<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">马俊龙律师</strong>应花椒学社邀请，为三十多家餐饮企业老板、法人等带来《餐饮企业顶层股权架构搭建》（新《公司法》对餐饮企业有哪些重大影响？）专题分享会，同时马俊龙律师作为花椒学社连锁模型专家深度赋能餐饮行业，解决数百家餐饮企业法律问题。马律师专业生动的分享获得在场餐饮人的好评与认可。</p></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 48px;line-height: 1;color: rgb(150, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">PART</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"transform: rotateZ(171deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(171deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(171deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(171deg);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 93.5132px;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;border-top: 1px solid rgb(150, 0, 0);height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 48px;color: rgb(150, 0, 0);line-height: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">01</strong></p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: right;font-size: 18px;padding: 0px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">新公司法对餐饮企业产生的影响</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(206, 210, 213);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">New company law<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">Impact on catering services</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 30px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">新《公司法》于2024年7月1日正式施行。中国人民大学法学院刘俊海教授这样评价本次《公司法》修订：是中小股东的春天；是公司债权人的夏天；是董事、监事、高管的秋天；是控股股东、实际控制人的冬天。<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">那么新《公司法》的实施，对餐饮企业的经营会产生哪些实质性的影响？</strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">马律师从如下四个方面对上述影响进行阐述：（1）给品牌创始人、实际控制人带来的风险；（2）给公司董事、监事、高管带来的风险；（3）中小股东如何利用新《公司法》维护自身权益；（4）新法修订给公司外部债权人带来的机会。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">此外，马律师还从新公司法施行对于直营模式股权架构的影响、对于连锁加盟股权架构的影响、对于餐饮门店合伙模式的影响、对于股权顶层架构搭建的影响等四个方面给大家带来了精彩分享。</p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JlJ4EzGFC1aHQGzImCnmwWGDFcn0eLlm4EoaMica2S8XaXKLjlwRsbzXg8v1ibic30iajtPiafkV9wSyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=2\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 608px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JlJ4EzGFC1aHQGzImCnmwWjyOHZ3iaafBevy2MMsYCCudohicPtIhK6XgthazibMluMAnibgW236Yy9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 608px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 48px;line-height: 1;color: rgb(150, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">PART</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"transform: rotateZ(171deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(171deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(171deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(171deg);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 93.5132px;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;border-top: 1px solid rgb(150, 0, 0);height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 48px;color: rgb(150, 0, 0);line-height: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">02</strong></p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: right;font-size: 18px;padding: 0px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">餐饮企业顶层股权架构搭建</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(206, 210, 213);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">Catering enterprise<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">Ownership structure</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 30px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">马律师通过几个知名餐饮品牌案例分析为大家分析了餐饮门店直营及加盟模式的典型架构搭建以及顶层股权架构的搭建。</span><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">随着税务稽查的日趋严格，马律师提示餐饮企业需要更加注重合规经营及企业的规模化发展，那么了解新《公司法》就有其必要及深远的意义。</span><br></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JlJ4EzGFC1aHQGzImCnmwWeNg9wzQtFqBLNm3KU4dYGjgTkt63JKxG9KILUhrusqsH05QvqaFHRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=4\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 608px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"7\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JlJ4EzGFC1aHQGzImCnmwWicZGRshq5CAZviaT6nU04DBjNHKPAyI4oWTVib0oGOnCY594zcomHwJZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=5\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 608px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"8\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 30px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">本次分享会，解决了诸多餐饮企业在日常运营中面临的法律风险和问题，解答了餐饮老板在新《公司法》方面的疑问。合理的学习使用《公司法》，不但不踩坑，还能保护自身权益。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;margin: 10px 0%;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;line-height: 0;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"height: auto;transform: scale(0.6);-webkit-transform: scale(0.6);-moz-transform: scale(0.6);-o-transform: scale(0.6);transform-origin: center center;-webkit-transform-origin: center center;-moz-transform-origin: center center;-o-transform-orig